// Debug-only settings (see iosApp/README.md).
//
// Optional build-time base URL override, written into Info.plist as `MockBaseURL`. Empty = production
// API. The `MOCK_BASE_URL` launch environment variable (used by the XCUITests) takes precedence.
// xcconfig treats `//` as a comment, so escape the scheme separator:
//   MOCK_BASE_URL = http:/$()/localhost:8080
MOCK_BASE_URL =
